TheTaxCalc Tax Calculator Data Protection — Tax Calculators\"/><meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Learn how TheTaxCalc collects, uses, and protects your personal information when using our free tax calculators.\"/><meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://thetaxcalc.com/privacy\"/><meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"TheTaxCalc\"/><meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\"/><meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://thetaxcalc.com/opengraph-image.png\"/><meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1200\"/><meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"630\"/><meta property=\"og:image:alt\" content=\"Privacy Policy — TheTaxCalc Tax Calculator Data Protection — TheTaxCalc\"/><meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\"/><meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\"/><meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"TheTaxCalc — Free 2026 Paycheck &amp; Mortgage Calculator\"/><meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"Compute your take-home pay after federal, FICA, and state taxes. Supports IL, TX, FL, CA, NY.\"/><meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://thetaxcalc.com/opengraph-image.png\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon.ico\"/><link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" href=\"/apple-touch-icon.png\"/><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@graph\":[{\"@id\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com/#organization\",\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"TheTaxCalc\",\"url\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com\",\"logo\":{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"url\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com/icon.png\"},\"description\":\"Free 2026 tax calculators — paycheck, mortgage, 401(k), capital gains, and self-employment. Trusted by thousands of users for accurate, up-to-date tax estimates.\",\"foundingDate\":\"2022\",\"sameAs\":[\"https://thetaxcalc.com/about\",\"https://thetaxcalc.com/blog\",\"https://thetaxcalc.com/research\",\"https://thetaxcalc.com/methodology\"],\"contactPoint\":[{\"@type\":\"ContactPoint\",\"url\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com/about#contact\",\"contactType\":\"customer support\",\"availableLanguage\":[\"English\"]}]},{\"@id\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com/#website\",\"@type\":\"WebSite\",\"name\":\"TheTaxCalc\",\"url\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com\",\"description\":\"Free 2026 tax calculators — paycheck, mortgage, 401(k), capital gains, and self-employment.\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\",\"publisher\":{\"@id\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com/#organization\"},\"potentialAction\":{\"@type\":\"SearchAction\",\"target\":{\"@type\":\"EntryPoint\",\"urlTemplate\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com/?q={search_term_string}\"},\"query-input\":\"required name=search_term_string\"}},{\"@id\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com/#webpage-home\",\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"name\":\"2026 Tax Calculator — Paycheck & Take-Home Pay | 50 States\",\"description\":\"Free 2026 tax calculator. Take-home pay after federal, FICA & state tax. 64 tools & 50-state sales tax data. No sign-up.\",\"url\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\",\"isPartOf\":{\"@id\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com/#website\"},\"about\":{\"@type\":\"Thing\",\"name\":\"Tax Calculator\"}}]}</script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/0cz1d0mv5g_q7.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body class=\"geist_a71539c9-module__T19VSG__variable geist_mono_8d43a2aa-module__8Li5zG__variable antialiased bg-background text-foreground\"><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><a href=\"#main-content\" class=\"sr-only focus:not-sr-only focus:fixed focus:top-4 focus:left-4 focus:z-[9999] focus:rounded-lg focus:bg-emerald-600 focus:px-4 focus:py-2 focus:text-white focus:shadow-lg\">Skip to main content</a><div class=\"min-h-screen flex flex-col bg-background bg-mesh\"><a href=\"#main-content\" class=\"sr-only focus:not-sr-only focus:fixed focus:top-4 focus:left-4 focus:z-[100] focus:rounded-lg focus:bg-emerald-600 focus:px-4 focus:py-2 focus:text-white focus:shadow-lg\">Skip to main content</a><header class=\"sticky top-0 z-[100] w-full glass-strong overflow-visible\"><div class=\"h-[2px] bg-gradient-to-r from-